    What the app's captures FileProvider is willing to hand out — the one cache directory a
    test photograph is written to, and nothing else. Named exactly rather than granted as
    `cache-path .` with an empty path, for the same reason the diagnostics scope is: the cache
    holds whatever else the app and its libraries have put there, and sharing a photograph
    must not become a door onto all of it.
-->
<paths>
    <cache-path
        name="captures"
        path="glasses-captures/" />
</paths>
